WEBVTT

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.360
You got here sooner...

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.070
No, later than I expected,

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.650
Irisviel.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:21.000
So you're in princess mode? 
That will make this go more quickly.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.410
Explain what's going on!

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:27.420
The Holy Grail War formula has activated.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.120
That's impossible...

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.380
It can't have activated on its own, 
not while I'm here.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:38.850
I'm saying the one that activated is 
different from that of the Einzberns.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.520
What do you...

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:46.480
Right now, an incredible disaster is 
being born in the great cavern.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:52.600
And at its center stand Miyu Edelfelt and Illyasviel.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.670
It's futile.

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:57.450
The Church did not foresee this situation.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.880
Nothing can be done.

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.810
Not by us, nor by you.

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:09.670
<b>Episode 10 
Calling Your Name From 
a Corner of the World</b>

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:16.800
Just what are you?

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:22.350
I'm mad at you.

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:25.390
"Break it. Along with me"?

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:29.900
"I'm sorry to have dragged you into 
this, when you weren't involved"?

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:31.360
Those...

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:34.570
Those aren't things you say to a friend!

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:38.570
I'm going to drag you out of there and slap you!

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:43.750
Incredible.

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:45.000
You're incredible.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.960
To be honest, I was slightly worried

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:51.630
that no one would be able 
to give me a good fight!

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.320
A one-sided slaughter is pointless.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:57.010
Now, let us fight for it!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.300
For the Holy Grail!

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:11.020
Kuro! Bazett!

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:13.060
Wh-What's going on?

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:14.480
Where are Miyu and Illyasviel?

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:19.910
Miyu's been sucked into that thing, 
and Illya's trying to save her.

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:21.870
No way.

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:24.530
You mean that's Illya?

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:25.980
Yes.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:30.700
The two sticks have united to call 
forth her true power, I suppose.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:32.240
That's possible?

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:36.260
No, even if it were, the scale 
of her power is too great.

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:40.120
I find it hard to believe that one 
person can use that much mana!

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.930
With output like that...

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.600
She's using some kind of trick to do it.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:48.250
And, clearly, one that will come at a price.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.590
Listen, Illya-san.

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:03.340
Please keep this fight as short as possible.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:07.310
This mode intentionally tricks parts

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:11.080
that aren't Magic Circuits into 
operating as fake ones.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:16.420
That means muscles, blood vessels,
lymphatic system, and even nerves.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.670
In other words, the more you use this power,

00:03:20.670 --> 00:03:23.140
the more you wear out and damage all of them.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:28.930
Kuro? What's wrong?

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.190
Nothing!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:32.890
It's nothing...

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.250
Nothing at all!

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:38.600
Your shared pain is that bad?

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.460
Using that much power

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.550
will eventually entail more than pain.

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:58.000
Just how reckless is she going to be?

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:00.960
If we can, we should probably stop her.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:03.010
Illya!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.640
That's not... That's not it!

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:07.550
Kuro...

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:13.150
If Illya is pushing herself to try and rescue 
Miyu, we shouldn't be stopping her!

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:16.480
We should be pushing her forward!

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:19.360
Yeah, right now...

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.400
It is exactly as Kuro says.

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:03.080
Now!

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:07.070
Here we go!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:07.870
Got it!

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:25.590
Illya-san, the strain on your body...

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:26.760
I'm fine.

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:31.430
I'll break through this thing in no time!

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:34.090
Yes!

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.020
We did it!

00:05:50.590 --> 00:05:51.590
I see.

00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:54.500
You can pierce even the shield of gods?

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:58.080
In that case, perhaps it will come true.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:02.130
Will you destroy yourself for a friend?

00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:05.130
Yes... You are...

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:06.840
You are the one...

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.540
worthy of my full might!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.240
This fierce wind...

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:16.480
The same as before?

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:19.660
This scale... This is no joke!

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:20.720
It can't be...

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:22.770
He still had strength to spare?

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:27.440
It has no name. I have been calling it simply "Ea."

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:32.000
The oldest sword, which 
divided Heaven from Earth,

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.370
literally rending creation
itself to forge this world.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:41.400
Can you feel the memory of creation 
carved into your genes?

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:44.800
It will tear you apart, along with this cradle,

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:48.520
to initiate the hell of genesis right here!

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:53.470
Ruby, that wasn't our full power yet, was it?

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.470
Illya-san, you can't...

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:58.930
Either way, if we lose here, we're finished.

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.340
But...

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:01.710
So, please.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:06.460
My muscles, my veins, my nerves...

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.030
Use everything I have!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.330
<i>Enuma Elish!</i>

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:18.540
<i>Quintet Fire!</i>

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:42.150
<i>I hear water.</i>

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:45.780
<i>Even though there's no light or sound here...</i>

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:51.920
<i>Why is this sound the only one I can hear?</i>

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:54.910
<i>There's nothing but darkness.</i>

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.810
<i>This is where I belong.</i>

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:01.120
<i>The world where I was born</i>

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:03.340
<i>as the Holy Grail.</i>

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:08.210
<i>I am a vessel whose role is to bestow light.</i>

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:12.050
<i>I need no light for myself.</i>

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.180
<i>Yet...</i>

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:17.220
<i>There were those who gave me light.</i>

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:20.220
<i>People who gave me a place to belong.</i>

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:24.730
<i>There was a world in which I 
could be just slightly human.</i>

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:27.400
<i>But...</i>

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:31.560
<i>That gentle lie has come to an end.</i>

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:35.250
<i>The three months I spent in this world...</i>

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:40.120
<i>That was probably the final 
dream I've been granted.</i>

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:45.710
<i>I could not escape my fate, after all.</i>

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:52.270
I pray you find a world where you 
won't have to suffer any longer.

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:55.340
<i>Even though he wished that for me,</i>

00:08:55.340 --> 00:09:00.290
<i>all I could do was escape to another world.</i>

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:03.510
<i>Ah, but...</i>

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:06.270
I pray that you meet kind people.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:10.430
<i>I did. I met very kind people.</i>

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:13.860
I pray you find friends you can laugh with.

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:19.740
<i>Yes, I did. Precious friends.</i>

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:22.970
<i>One with very pretty silver hair.</i>

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:26.210
I pray you find a warm, small...

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.680
<i>She was like moonlight.</i>

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.100
...share of happiness.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.840
<i>Her name was...</i>

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:38.560
Illya?

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:47.650
That's the first time I've seen you cry.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:48.580
Huh?

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:57.820
Miyu! Illyasviel!

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.030
Are you two all right?

00:09:59.030 --> 00:09:59.960
Yeah.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.350
Miyu-sama!

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:03.790
Sapphire...

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:06.250
Illya!

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.460
Hey, you...

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:13.960
I just got a little dizzy.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:13.960
Miyu...

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:16.200
Luvia-san...

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:17.810
I'm sorr—

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:21.360
You had me worried.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:27.010
Jeez, you were way too reckless. Couldn't you—

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:29.240
No! Illya-san isn't at fault!

00:10:29.240 --> 00:10:29.850
Huh?

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:35.820
The original problem was the fact that 
you weren't fit to be my Master!

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:38.810
What? You...

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:39.660
Kuro...

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.410
What?

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:45.870
Sorry.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:51.290
"Sorry" isn't right.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:55.230
You're right. Thank you.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.260
I'm glad you were here!

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:00.220
Hmph.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:03.760
Good grief... You should be grateful. We—

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:04.930
Illya...

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:12.770
I...

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:16.480
Miyu... You know, I always knew.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:20.490
I knew you were carrying some big secret.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:21.700
Huh?

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:25.740
I knew, but I couldn't bring myself to ask.

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:31.620
I thought that if I mentioned your secret, 
we might never go back to the way we had been.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:34.340
I did, too—

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:37.300
But you know, I won't run anymore.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:41.810
You're my friend.

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:45.430
I can't just stand by and let 
my friend suffer anymore.

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:49.100
You're not alone, Miyu.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.280
Yeah...

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:57.180
My, my! I thought you were going to slap her?

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.650
I did plan on doing that...

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:03.110
I'm sorry, Illya.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.350
It's fine.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.530
Come on, let's go.

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:09.580
Time to go home.

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:17.120
Yeah.

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:23.930
Looks like it's over.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.930
Seems so!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.570
It's rather strange.

00:12:28.090 --> 00:12:31.890
That ominous expression you had until 
a moment ago seems like a lie now.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.380
Yes.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:35.340
I was just so frustrated...

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:38.380
I was so worried about those 
children, I couldn't bear it.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:45.160
But when I see them smile so happily, 
all of that just disappears.

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:58.670
Illya-san and Kuro-san don't seem to be getting up.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.980
Did they stay up all night?

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:02.150
I don't know.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:03.670
I'll go check on them.

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:07.800
Thank you. I'll prepare breakfast.

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.310
<b>Illya's Room</b>

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.690
Onii-chan?

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:31.110
Illya, time to wake up—

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.040
Sorry.

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:39.880
Ah, that familiar scream of a maiden.

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.130
No way!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:42.710
No way...

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:43.970
Shirou?!

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:47.090
Yes, it seems they've been awake for a bit.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:51.220
I didn't see them changing
or anything, so don't worry.

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:54.060
I... I see.

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.670
I couldn't help it.

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:58.730
I used too much yesterday, so it was urgent.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:02.110
That doesn't mean you can 
attack me in my sleep!

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:05.820
I thought you were tired, so I was trying 
to be nice and let you keep sleeping!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:08.240
I don't need that kind of concern from you!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.430
You two are pretty close, aren't you?

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:11.200
Huh?

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:14.650
Onii-chan, are you sure you aren't 
misunderstanding what happened?

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:18.830
Yeah! Illya just jumped on me
while she was still half-asleep.

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:21.770
What are you saying?! You were half-asleep!

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:24.570
No! That was you!

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:25.920
No, you!

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:27.210
No, that's not what I meant.

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:30.150
Then...

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:31.300
What did you mean?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:35.980
It's not that easy to find someone 
you can argue with without restraint.

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:37.610
Yeah.

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.820
Though, well, you know...

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:46.710
Even if you are at a curious age, 
you should keep that stuff in moderation.

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:49.200
I told you, that was a misunderstanding!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:56.370
You two shouldn't get too indulgent,
even if it is summer break.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:59.500
We wouldn't want you getting sick.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.900
Okay.

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:03.250
Now, let's have breakfast.

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:08.420
Let's eat!

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.180
Huh? Where's Mama?

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.680
Is she still asleep?

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.120
She woke up early and went out.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:16.890
She said something about taking 
care of the mountain?

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.350
Ah...

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:21.350
More importantly, eat up before it's too late.

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:23.310
Why?

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:28.240
Didn't you say you were going to have your
friends over to finish summer homework today?

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:29.740
Ah...

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.950
What?! You haven't made any progress since then?

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:33.910
I'm sorry!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:38.380
It's rare for Illya to ignore her share of the work.

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:39.580
Did something happen?

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:43.420
How do I put it? Things got kind of hectic...

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:44.730
I know what you mean!

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:49.990
When you keep making ice, shaving it, 
and pouring syrup over it, time just flies!

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:52.720
And you wasted your precious 
break making shaved ices?

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:55.520
Just how many did you make?

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:57.640
What about you two, then?

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:02.730
I tried, but I barely understood any of it.

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:04.900
I tried, but I couldn't write legibly.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.360
The Blue Hawaii tasted the best!

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.280
None of us should talk.

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:12.950
I'm not sure Tatsuko even 
remembers what homework is.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:14.830
How about you, Mimi?

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:18.200
I'm sorry. I only managed to do half.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.230
That's surprising. You seem like 
someone who'd finish it.

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:24.170
Now, don't be too hard on Mimi.

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:27.850
Everyone's first summer after 
awakening is a busy time.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:31.330
Mimi, you...

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:33.130
Is your regular life okay?

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.920
But what should we do?

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:37.100
It sounds like none of us has gotten much done.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.560
Do it on your own!

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.640
Only someone who can do it 
by herself can say that.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:46.140
I know! In that case, let's get Miyu to help.

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:47.120
Yeah.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:50.530
Knowing Miyu, even if she hasn't finished, 
she can solve it for us fast.

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:52.140
Good idea!

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:56.200
But last time we invited her...

00:16:56.920 --> 00:17:00.410
The rest? But I can do it on my own.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:03.070
...she turned us down.

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:05.320
Well, that sounds like Miyu.

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:08.630
Even if we asked, she'd 
probably turn us down again...

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:11.090
It'll be fine.

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.650
You think so?

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:15.600
Miyukichi is really cold when she acts cold!

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:17.940
It's one thing if it's give and take.

00:17:17.940 --> 00:17:20.720
But we'd just be learning from her...

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:22.970
We don't know that yet.

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:24.180
Yeah, but...

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:28.770
Don't decide it'll be a bother 
before you even talk to her.

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:30.140
Right, Illya?

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:31.660
Yeah.

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:40.220
I can't believe she agreed right away.

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:41.830
That was easy.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.180
Illya...

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:49.190
You use this formula on that problem.

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:51.960
Okay!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.800
Mimi, show me how to do this math problem!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.010
Hmm? Which one?

00:17:57.010 --> 00:18:01.060
"Please identify which of the 
following cards is the eighth,

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:04.850
when arranged in order."

00:18:05.360 --> 00:18:07.360
Oh, uh...

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:09.940
Th-This problem about playing cards, right?

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.070
Y-Yeah.

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:13.000
Something wrong?

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:15.750
N-No, nothing's wrong.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:19.320
Hey! This one, too!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:25.370
Let's see... "Please list all the cards 
that are parallel to the queen."

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:27.460
What's wrong with you three?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.500
Did I say something strange?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:33.790
N-No, nothing at all! Right, Kuro? Miyu?

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:35.210
It's nothing...

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:37.230
Something's suspicious.

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:39.090
Are you hiding something?

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:48.250
What?

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:49.730
What's gotten into you now?

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.990
Was something funny?

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:53.270
A staring contest?

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:56.240
What? What?

00:18:56.910 --> 00:18:59.200
I'm not really sure, but...

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:04.160
Miyu-chan seems a bit softer than before.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:14.090
Ah, jeez! What am I supposed to report?

00:19:14.510 --> 00:19:16.770
The eighth Card disappeared somewhere.

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:19.380
And there's a huge crater in the mountain, too!

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:22.430
Just say something convenient. 
It doesn't matter what.

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.970
Lies and bluffs are your forte, aren't they?

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:31.520
The Cards aside, what are you going 
to do about Miyu-san's existence?

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:34.470
I-I'm not planning to hide it.

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:36.940
I just won't report it outright.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.390
Exactly.

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:40.950
Is that so?

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:43.530
Yes, it is.

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:48.160
Anyway, other circumstances aside, 
that girl is my little sister.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:52.600
Is it necessary to report 
every last thing about family?

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:54.420
Luvia-sama...

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:58.340
Well, I think that's a good idea, too.

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:03.120
After all, from the moment these two 
claim they're still our owners,

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:05.170
the report is already false!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:11.800
By the way, how do you plan 
on reporting these events?

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:14.900
Naturally, I will report them straightforwardly.

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:15.690
What?

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:18.690
But then your report will differ from ours!

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:20.690
You needn't worry.

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:24.770
The top brass are infighting 
and are unable to get along.

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:28.050
Even if there are inconsistencies 
between separate factions,

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:29.980
it will take them a while to notice.

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:31.510
O-Oh!

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:33.420
That's fortunate.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:37.240
You two, that might work for now...

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:41.310
But what do you plan to do 
once that fighting settles down?

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:47.520
That is

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.520
something to think about then!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.880
This musclehead...

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.220
Ah, this is rough!

00:20:57.220 --> 00:21:00.320
I don't know why we're all acting so weird.

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:01.490
Right?

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:04.410
Illya and Kuro...

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:10.900
If you hold back too much with 
your friends, they'll slap you.

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:13.810
You're right.

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:14.870
Yeah, yeah.

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:20.970
Oh? That was a good bit of advice.

00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:23.750
Then we won't hold back on getting you to help us.

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:24.550
Illya!

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:27.800
Teach me from here to here!

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:31.560
Tatsuko-chan, you're asking her 
to teach you everything?

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:34.710
What?! That's asking too much!

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:37.790
Isn't it great to have so many friends, Illya?

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:40.720
This and that aren't...

00:21:40.720 --> 00:21:43.110
Friends are difficult.

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:46.150
Hey, we're your friends, too!

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:47.720
We're counting on you!

00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:50.350
Also, help me with my free 
research and summer diary!

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:53.120
Tatsuko-chan, at least do the diary yourself.

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:59.180
Ah, jeez, cut it out!

00:22:49.190 --> 00:22:51.590
What is this?

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:54.520
There's a distortion in space here.

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:57.230
It's hard to believe that

00:22:57.610 --> 00:23:00.190
the crater just disappeared.

00:23:00.690 --> 00:23:01.920
What do you mean?

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:05.360
The entire space has been swapped.

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:06.450
In other words...

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:10.910
You can't mean... it's a parallel world?

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:36.430
<b>Fate/kaleid liner PRISMA ILLYA 3rei!!</b>
